<title>CHINA: Furama Hotel year net up 10.93 percent.</title>
<headline>Furama Hotel year net up 10.93 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   122.0  vs 113.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs 47.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    248.69 vs 224.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     790.59 vs 724.82</p>
<p>    Company name		 Furama Hotel Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Furama Hotel is a hotel operator and owner.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 23 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 23 cents) vs 70 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
